  "notes": [
    "The module only runs recipes in its Merkle root (slot 5). Replaying the anchor against the root before 0xe7b6cd64 reverts, and keepers first used this swap recipe 5,000 blocks after it, so that root update, not the earlier executor grant of the router, set the exploitable state.",
    "Campaign: every router self-call after the anchor that executed a module on a Safe (trace_filter on the router to the latest block); six router calls that executed no module are left out. Four Safes lost assets.",
    "Loss nets each Safe per tx: after its first drain, nine calls on Safe 0xb7255336 only routed PAXG through it with no net outflow, so 0.35 PAXG is counted, not 0.70."
  ]
